## Input

```css
$index: 2;
$tag: article;
$id: panel;
$placeholder: utility;
$pseudo: state;
$attribute: mode;
$base-loading: ".vab-loading-type";
$prefix: md-;

#{$base-loading}1 {
  color: red;
}

#{$tag}1 {
  color: red;
}

.item-#{$index}0 {
  color: red;
}

.weight-#{$index}00 {
  color: red;
}

##{$id}1 {
  color: red;
}

%#{$placeholder}1 {
  color: red;
}

:#{$pseudo}1 {
  color: red;
}

::#{$pseudo}1 {
  color: red;
}

[data-#{$attribute}1] {
  color: red;
}

.column-#{$prefix}1-of-12 {
  color: red;
}

